sequenceDiagram
    title DSD — CU-164 Consultar El Historial De Vehiculos De Un Chofer
autonumber
participant CTRL as DeliveryVehicleController
participant VSRV as VehicleAssignmentService
participant AREP as RepositoryVehicleAssignment

CTRL->>VSRV: historialDelChofer(id, distributorId, pagination)
activate VSRV
VSRV->>VSRV: assertChoferDelTenant(id, distributorId)
alt chofer inexistente o de otra distribuidora
    VSRV-->>CTRL: NotFoundException
else chofer del tenant
    VSRV->>AREP: findAndCount(where delivery_id, relations car, order assigned_at DESC, take, skip)
    activate AREP
    AREP-->>VSRV: filas y total
    deactivate AREP
    VSRV-->>CTRL: filas y total
    CTRL->>CTRL: informarTotal(res, total) en X-Total-Count
    CTRL->>CTRL: filas.map(VehicleAssignmentMapper.toHistoryDto)
end
deactivate VSRV
